# Shared block: the players table of a game-setup screen (skirmish, LAN, online). Included by the screen's layout; `$`
# names resolve against the including screen. Panel at left 64, top 124, 1104 x 832; header at 150, rule at 182, eight
# rows of 40-tall controls from 204 at a pitch of 48. The first row is the local player: a name entry on the skirmish
# screen (TextEntryPlayerName), a player slot combo elsewhere (ComboBoxPlayer0); whichever the screen has is placed.
panel left top 64 124 1104 832
rule left top 84 182 1064
window $StaticTextPlayers left top 84 150 260 28 meta
window $StaticTextColor left top 360 150 140 28 meta
window $StaticTextFaction left top 516 150 400 28 meta
window $StaticTextTeam left top 1046 150 110 28 meta

window $TextEntryPlayerName left top 84 204 260 40 entry
window $ComboBoxPlayer0 left top 84 204 260 40 dropdown
window $ComboBoxColor0 left top 360 204 140 40 dropdown
window $ComboBoxPlayerTemplate0 left top 516 204 514 40 dropdown
window $ComboBoxTeam0 left top 1046 204 110 40 dropdown

window $ComboBoxPlayer1 left top 84 252 260 40 dropdown
window $ComboBoxColor1 left top 360 252 140 40 dropdown
window $ComboBoxPlayerTemplate1 left top 516 252 514 40 dropdown
window $ComboBoxTeam1 left top 1046 252 110 40 dropdown

window $ComboBoxPlayer2 left top 84 300 260 40 dropdown
window $ComboBoxColor2 left top 360 300 140 40 dropdown
window $ComboBoxPlayerTemplate2 left top 516 300 514 40 dropdown
window $ComboBoxTeam2 left top 1046 300 110 40 dropdown

